# Lost in Space: "Target artifact or creature's owner puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their library. Surveil 1." Bot1 pays {3}{U} with four
# Moxen. A Mountain (neither an artifact nor a creature) is refused as a target. Bot2's Ornithopter, an artifact creature, is accepted: its owner Bot2 chooses
# the top (Accept) and draws it again in turn 4. Then Bot1 surveils 1 and puts the Forest into its graveyard.

